msgid ""
"The running Docker daemon is rootless, so it does not read this file. "
"Changes here only affect a system-wide daemon."
msgstr "正在运行的 Docker 守护进程是 rootless 的，不会读取这"
"个文件。这里的修改只对系统级守护进程生效。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:222
msgid ""
"Settings are read-only until you unlock them. Unlocking asks for "
"administrator rights; the authorization lasts about five minutes."
