msgstr "恢复上一版本"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:485
msgid "Writes to %1 (a backup is kept before every save)."
msgstr "写入 %1（每次保存前都会保留一份备份）。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:493
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "未保存的修改"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:504
msgid "Restart Docker"
msgstr "重启 Docker"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:505
msgid "Restart the Docker service now?"
msgstr "现在重启 Docker 服务吗？"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:507
msgid "Running containers are kept because live-restore is enabled."
msgstr "已启用 live-restore，运行中的容器会保留。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:508
msgid ""
"One running container will be stopped; it comes back automatically if its "
"restart policy says so."
msgid_plural ""
"%1 running containers will be stopped; they come back automatically if their "
"restart policy says so."
msgstr[0] "有 %1 个正在运行的容器会被停止；如果设置了重启"
"策略，它们会自动恢复。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:522
msgid ""
"Docker restarted. The page refreshes once the engine is reachable again."
msgstr "Docker 已重启。引擎恢复可访问后页面会自动刷新。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:523
msgid "Restarting Docker failed (%1)."
msgstr "重启 Docker 失败（%1）。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:532
msgid "Replace the current configuration with the most recent backup?"
msgstr "用最近的备份替换当前配置吗？"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:533
msgid ""
"The current file is backed up first, so this can be undone the same way."
msgstr "当前文件会先被备份，因此同样可以再撤回来。"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:534
msgid "Restore"
msgstr "恢复"

#: src/ui/DaemonConfigPage.qml:539
msgid "Previous configuration restored. Docker must be restarted to apply it."
msgstr "已恢复上一份配置。需要重启 Docker 后才会生效。"

